# Calculations

## Remote (source of truth for full raglan output)

- Client: `utils/calculateRaglanCoreRemote.ts` → `supabase.functions.invoke('calculate-raglan')`.
- Core: `utils/raglan/` (entry `utils/calculateRaglan.ts`). Types: `utils/raglan/types.ts`.
- Setup: `SUPABASE_SETUP.md`, edge `supabase/functions/calculate-raglan/`, SQL migration in `supabase/migrations/`.

## Local helpers (`result/`)

- `increaseRowsRegular.ts` — regular increase-row placement + `determineIncreaseType`
- `vNeckCornerIncreases.ts` — `calculateVNeckIncreases*`
- `increaseRowsVNeck.ts` — `*V` suffixed row helpers (distinct return field names)
- Barrel: `helpers.ts` → re-exported from `index.tsx`
- Regular result precompute: `useRegularIncreasePrecompute.ts`

## introState

- Populated from remote response in `syncRaglanFromSupabase` — UI reads `introState` fields, not raw API in screens.

## Chart increase rows (`screens/styles/raglan/`)

- `increaseRowSelection.ts` — build strings + type switch + side cell counts
- `increaseArrayRenderers.tsx` — left/right/body grid JSX

Changing formulas: verify both regular and v-neck result/chart screens still match expected numbers.
